00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.950
Does that, can we, can we make that trade?

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.340
Is that allowed?

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.040
- No comment on this (indistinct).

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.690
We have some new Teenage
Mutant Ninja Turtle stuff

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.620
coming up, which I'm super excited about.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.440
- Is it, you know, one
thing I'm very fascinated.

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:30.390
I just heard New
SpongeBob, New TMT, right?

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:33.150
Like it's kind of intriguing.

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:35.720
Just give a little glimpse
into this that I think

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:37.490
a lot of viewers wouldn't think about,

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.690
which is the incredible opportunity that

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:43.010
once a franchise does hit that status,

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:47.590
it really does play "in perpetuity."

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:51.280
Like, you actually get
to reboot, restructure,

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:53.450
think about, spin off.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:56.650
It is a real gift to be able to play

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:57.720
with these kinds of franchises.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:12:59.230
It's also probably a huge responsibility.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:01.410
I'm sure there's a lot of
emotion and politics behind it,

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:02.820
but it is fascinating.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:05.190
I mean, just when I
heard you say, you know,

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.049
some New SpongeBob, I'm like, "Ooh!"

00:13:07.049 --> 00:13:08.170
You know, TMT, "Ooh!"

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:10.960
Like, it's powerful to
have these franchises.

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:11.793
Thoughts?

00:13:11.793 --> 00:13:12.990
- Extremely powerful for us.

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:15.900
And just also, we have
the whole CP side of this.

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:19.080
So we know that, you know,
that from a plush perspective,

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.970
like Blues Clues right now is
the number one toy in Walmart,

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:23.590
