00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:25.810
I think people are
looking for some comfort.

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:28.400
But we have that whole
side of where it actually,

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:31.400
we can actually touch lives in a bunch

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.130
of different areas when we
create these franchises.

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:36.219
But like SpongeBob, yes,
New SpongeBob still plays

00:13:36.219 --> 00:13:38.230
incredibly well.

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.300
And then also the spinoffs,
like we're talking,

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:42.381
