into a different realm.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.430
But also just as the same-

00:14:01.430 --> 00:14:02.427
- I thought that was super, I saw it,

00:14:02.427 --> 00:14:03.810
it was super clever.

00:14:03.810 --> 00:14:05.710
Like, that was a challenge.

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:06.570
- Oh, a huge challenge.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.960
- When I first heard it, I'm like, "Ooh."

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.010
I thought it was extremely well done.

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.670
Not, by the way, not "ooh" like
I don't, like I was pumped.

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:14.580
I was like, "Ooh."

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:15.747
I'm an operator, so I'm like,

00:14:15.747 --> 00:14:17.360
"Ooh, how the hell would I operate that?

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:18.820
Like, where are you going
creatively with that?"

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:20.650
I thought it was super clever where they-

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:22.660
- I think the biggest
thing that was hard is

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:25.090
that SpongeBob doesn't know people exist.

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.929
So he doesn't really understand the world.

00:14:26.929 --> 00:14:28.682
(laughing)

00:14:28.682 --> 00:14:30.770
And so then you've got people
playing SpongeBob and Patrick.

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:32.240
And so there's that little suspension

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.710
of disbelief you have to create.

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:36.920
And those characters have to really embody

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.850
those characters under
the sea in Bikini Bottom,

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.633
and they did an incredible job.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.850
- Jenny, you did an incredible job here.

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:44.750
